post_install() {
  cat << EOF
==> Lichess-CLI Setup Required <==

Lichess-CLI requires an API Token to function.
Please follow these steps to complete the setup:

1. Create token lichess from this link:
   https://lichess.org/account/oauth/token

2. Create the configuration directory:
   mkdir -p ~/.config/lichess-cli/

3. Copy the sample configuration file and edit it:
   cp /usr/share/doc/lichess-cli/config.json.example ~/.config/lichess-cli/config.json

4. Open ~/.config/lichess-cli/config.json and replace the placeholder "YOUR_API_KEY_HERE" with your actual Lichess API Token.

For more details, please check the lichess-cli GitHub page.
EOF
}

post_upgrade() {
  post_install
}